* The first hit launches on Counter Hit, causing a high launch if you brake it. Your main combo afterward is 236B > 623A/AC
* Unlike the light version, the air invincibility lasts all the way through the active frames, making it more generous as an anti-air
* Kenshiro's best Guard Cancel special, being a fast launcher
----
'''REV version (623AC)''': Much like the heavy version, but great combo filler, as well.
* All the same features as the Heavy version, but is slightly faster and does more damage on its own
* The follow-up kick can always REV Accel into 236AC

'''Debuff Trigger''': Only the follow-up kick can trigger the debuff. When it does so, it pops the opponent up slightly higher, but otherwise doesn't change Kenshiro's combos. 
}}

